{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kaho.visit",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "第二天她自己跑来",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kaho.visit",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kaho.visit",
    "idolId": "kaho",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "果然！然后我跟爸爸妈妈说了，他们说要支持我！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "所以，我想试试当偶像！！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她的眼睛一点都没有躲。）",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好。那——先带你看看事务所吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！诶嘿嘿！那，先从哪里看起呢——"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "你好——！",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇！……啊，你是昨天的——",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！我是小宫果穗！……哇，这里就是工作的地方！好厉害！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只是普通的办公室而已。话说回来，你今天来了，也就是说……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊，对了！",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我本来不太了解偶像，回去以后查了很多！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "然后发现，偶像好像能让所有人笑起来！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "这和最喜欢的英雄很像啊——我是这么想的！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "英雄啊……嗯，确实偶像也能让所有人笑起来！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
